| Long 2 | RISK-01 | “Seven pieces of evidence that protect you from a risky medical-travel offer.” | “A low quote can hide these seven medical-travel risks.” | 2 long |
| Short 1 | COST-02 | “Can you identify who owns each of these three bills?” | “A high Canadian quote still doesn’t make a Chengdu quote complete.” | 2 shorts |
| Short 2 | WAIT-01 | “What evidence should come before a decision driven by waiting?” | “A long wait does not automatically make medical travel right.” | 2 shorts |
